{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"へいっ！牙のネックレス買ってみたぜぇ！あみあみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/7611784/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ダイエットの効果あってか顔がほっそりしてきた？と聞かれただーー(*^^*)うへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ嬉しいなあみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の名古屋の時にみんなで手羽先さま食べ行った時の写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/7611784/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあーみんな幸せそう楽しそうね(o^^o)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そういえば今日ひなちまが飛鳥に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「飛鳥の腕細すぎて手羽先にしかみえないーあはははっひっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに飛鳥の腕に白ごま少々かけたらあみ間違えて食べちゃいそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーんちて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/7611784/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返すだら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.周り気にしながらバレないようにケーキ食べてたのはネタなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.確かにあれは大げさだったかもしれないが。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあの時は本気だった。シフォンケーキだけは譲れねえだー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.楽屋でバカやってるけどあみあみはボケとツッコミどっちなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみはもっぱらボケ！まあたまーにあみもツッコんでみたりあるけどまあほとんどボケてます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃん可愛すぎると思うけど間違ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.なにそのいじわるな質問ーΣ(￣。￣ﾉ)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い？？じゃあずーっとそう思ってなさいε=ε=ε=ε=ε=ε=┌(;￣◇￣)┘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.私は今日、トリマーの専門学校(訓練塾)に合格したんだけど、あみあみは犬好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きならば、どの犬種が好きか教えてほしい＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみ犬だぁぁーいすきっ！あみ動物だいだいすきだもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬種かあー秋田犬とか好きよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃんの、好きな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寿司のネタは、なんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.びんとろ、焼きハラス、いくら、ホタテ、ツブ貝。このローテーション！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみ好きな洋服のブランドゎ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ジュエティも好きだしearthとかＨ＆Ｍとか！いろいろ好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.芸人のロッチ中岡は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.面白いし好きだよおーー(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.好きな人はいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.好きな人はいません！でもファンの皆様がだいだいだいすきです\\(//∇//)\\！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.この服って、あみあみの私服なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.セーラー服？それは私服というよりネットで買いました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみのその色っぽい唇は、やっぱり口紅を付けてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.つけてる時がほとんどかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.もう俺のこと忘れたやろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.わ、忘れてませんっ！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.夢に出てきてくれますか～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.良いよーそのかわりあなたの夢の中で暴れて起こしてあげるっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみって読書好きなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.嫌いじゃないって感じ！！でも進んで自分からはあんまり読まないかな！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみ族ってなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみを応援してくれる人達の事を言います  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは動物で何が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.猫！犬！トラ！ハムスター！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いだいすきっ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.アップされている写真だども、2枚目のやつ、反転してるよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.本当だっ！気づかなかった！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみが好きなパスタはなぁ～に？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ペペロンチーノです。いや美味しすぎるもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.ナゴヤドーム行きたかったけど行けなかったけどどんな感じのイベだった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.すごい乃木坂ファンの方集まってくれて、いっぱいいっぱい盛り上がった！！本当楽しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/7611784/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみの夢はなにかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またその夢に向かってどのように努力してますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ夢に対しての努力は今はできてない。ただその夢にむかって一歩でも近づけるように努力してるよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.ナゴヤドームのイベのあと観光しましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.観光までは出来なかったけど、手羽先はたっくさん食らいついた！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あまり会いに行く機会が少ないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあみに会いにいってもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ええーもう来てよお来てよお！首長ぁくして待ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.一生、愛未単推しで良いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.覚悟はできてるのね？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條を一生全力で応援してやってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.ブログのコメントと、ファンレターだと、どっちが嬉しい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.どれが一番とかはないなあー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもファンレターとかだと手書きだから気持ちはすごく伝わってくるし嬉しいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.果たして東大受かると思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受かるって100パーセント信じればぜっったい受かるよ！引き寄せの法則！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.にぎにぎ会で、何回もループか、まとめて、長く何分か話す、どっちが良い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.何回も会いにきて？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでやー！い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/22/7611784/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみぶす。笑"}],"source":"archive"}